{"id":"ee0f7477-9579-41f8-9ce5-e6de758cae06","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:58:36.218Z","batchId":"onboarding_gpt-6-1-sol_low","approach":"html","modelId":"gpt-6.1-sol","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width:760px\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Get started</span>\n    <h1 class=\"h1\">Make yourself at home</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Set up your account and choose your preferences in three quick steps.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <nav aria-label=\"Onboarding progress\">\n    <ol class=\"grid cols-3\" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0\">\n      <li class=\"card stack gap-sm\" data-step=\"0\" aria-current=\"step\"><span class=\"badge\">1 · Current</span><strong>Account</strong></li>\n      <li class=\"card stack gap-sm\" data-step=\"1\"><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">2 · Upcoming</span><strong>Preferences</strong></li>\n      <li class=\"card stack gap-sm\" data-step=\"2\"><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">3 · Upcoming</span><strong>Done</strong></li>\n    </ol>\n  </nav>\n\n  <form id=\"onboarding\" class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"row between gap-sm\">\n      <span id=\"step-count\" class=\"small muted\">Step 1 of 3</span>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Your setup, your way</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"progress\" aria-label=\"Setup progress\"><div id=\"step-progress\" style=\"width:33.33%\"></div></div>\n\n    <section id=\"account-panel\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"account-title\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 id=\"account-title\" class=\"h2\" tabindex=\"-1\">Create your account</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Start with your name and email. Both fields are required.</p>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"label\">Full name\n        <input id=\"full-name\" name=\"name\" autocomplete=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Enter your full name\">\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"label\">Email address\n        <input id=\"email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" required placeholder=\"you@example.com\">\n      </label>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">This demo keeps your details in this page only. Nothing is sent or saved.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"preferences-panel\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"preferences-title\" hidden>\n      <div>\n        <h2 id=\"preferences-title\" class=\"h2\" tabindex=\"-1\">Choose your preferences</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Pick the experience that works for you. You can go back without losing your entries.</p>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"label\">Preferred appearance\n        <select id=\"appearance\" name=\"appearance\">\n          <option>Use system setting</option>\n          <option>Light</option>\n          <option>Dark</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3 class=\"h3\">Email preferences</h3>\n        <label class=\"label check\"><input id=\"tips\" type=\"checkbox\" checked> Send me helpful getting-started tips</label>\n        <label class=\"label check\"><input id=\"updates\" type=\"checkbox\"> Send me product news and updates</label>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Both are optional. Leave them unchecked if you prefer fewer emails.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"done-panel\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"done-title\" hidden>\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"badge\">Setup complete</span>\n        <h2 id=\"done-title\" class=\"h2\" tabindex=\"-1\">You're all set!</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Your demo setup is complete. Review your choices below, or go back to make changes.</p>\n      </div>\n      <dl class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row between gap-sm\"><dt class=\"muted\">Name</dt><dd id=\"summary-name\" style=\"margin:0\"></dd></div>\n        <div class=\"row between gap-sm\"><dt class=\"muted\">Email</dt><dd id=\"summary-email\" style=\"margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere\"></dd></div>\n        <div class=\"row between gap-sm\"><dt class=\"muted\">Appearance</dt><dd id=\"summary-appearance\" style=\"margin:0\"></dd></div>\n        <div class=\"row between gap-sm\"><dt class=\"muted\">Getting-started tips</dt><dd id=\"summary-tips\" style=\"margin:0\"></dd></div>\n        <div class=\"row between gap-sm\"><dt class=\"muted\">Product updates</dt><dd id=\"summary-updates\" style=\"margin:0\"></dd></div>\n      </dl>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">No account has been created and no preferences have been saved outside this demo.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n    <footer class=\"row between gap-sm\">\n      <button id=\"back\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\" disabled>Back</button>\n      <button id=\"next\" class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Next: Preferences →</button>\n    </footer>\n  </form>\n  <p id=\"finish-message\" class=\"alert\" role=\"status\" hidden>You're finished. Your setup summary remains above for reference.</p>\n</div>\n<style>[hidden]{display:none!important}</style>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  let step=0;\n  const form=document.getElementById('onboarding');\n  const panels=['account','preferences','done'];\n  const back=document.getElementById('back');\n  const next=document.getElementById('next');\n  function render(){\n    panels.forEach((name,i)=>{document.getElementById(name+'-panel').hidden=i!==step;});\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]').forEach((el,i)=>{\n      if(i===step) el.setAttribute('aria-current','step'); else el.removeAttribute('aria-current');\n      const badge=el.querySelector('span');\n      badge.className='badge'+(i>step?' badge-outline':i<step?' badge-secondary':'');\n      badge.textContent=(i+1)+' · '+(i===step?'Current':i<step?'Complete':'Upcoming');\n    });\n    document.getElementById('step-count').textContent='Step '+(step+1)+' of 3';\n    document.getElementById('step-progress').style.width=((step+1)/3*100)+'%';\n    back.disabled=step===0;\n    next.textContent=['Next: Preferences →','Next: Done →','Finish'][step];\n    next.disabled=false;\n    document.getElementById('finish-message').hidden=true;\n    document.getElementById(panels[step]+'-title').focus();\n  }\n  back.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(step>0){step--;render();}});\n  form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{\n    e.preventDefault();\n    if(step===0&&!form.reportValidity())return;\n    if(step===1){\n      ['name','email'].forEach(key=>{\n        document.getElementById('summary-'+key).textContent=document.getElementById(key==='name'?'full-name':'email').value.trim();\n      });\n      document.getElementById('summary-appearance').textContent=document.getElementById('appearance').value;\n      ['tips','updates'].forEach(key=>document.getElementById('summary-'+key).textContent=document.getElementById(key).checked?'Opted in':'Opted out');\n    }\n    if(step<2){step++;render();}\n    else{\n      document.getElementById('finish-message').hidden=false;\n      next.textContent='Finished';\n      next.disabled=true;\n    }\n  });\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[1285,"<div"],[1289," class"],[1289,"=\""],[1291,"page"],[1292," stack"],[1292," gap"],[1324,"-lg"],[1332,"\""],[1379," style"],[1382,"=\""],[1388,"max"],[1392,"-width"],[1394,":"],[1395,"760"],[1396,"px"],[1435,"\">\n"],[1442," "],[1445," <"],[1449,"header"],[1451," class"],[1451,"=\""],[1453,"stack"],[1453," gap"],[1487,"-sm"],[1